content.p:
Use the Lurch proof verification system to prove one of these subsets of
\mathbb R^3 is a subspace, and the other is not.

    \left\{ \left[\begin{array}{c}
    x \\
    y \\
    z
    \end{array}\right] \middle|
            {{Q_eq}}
    \right\}


    \left\{ \left[\begin{array}{c}
    x \\
    y \\
    z
    \end{array}\right] \middle|
            {{R_eq}}
    \right\}
